<title>USA: NYSEG adds 2 directors to board.</title>
<headline>NYSEG adds 2 directors to board.</headline>
<dateline>BINGHAMTON, N.Y. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York State Electric &amp; Gas Corp said its board Friday elected two new members, Richard Aurelio, senior adviser to Time Warner Inc and president of NY1 News; and Walter G. Rich, chief executive of Delaware Otsego Corp.</p>
<p>Aurelio and Rich will join the board effective April 11, increasing membership to 13 directors.</p>
